<span class="ltx_personname">Jian-Yun Nie
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span><span id="id23" class="ltx_text ltx_affiliation_institution">Université de Montréal</span>, <span id="id24" class="ltx_text ltx_affiliation_city">Montréal</span>, <span id="id25" class="ltx_text ltx_affiliation_state">Québec</span>, <span id="id26" class="ltx_text ltx_affiliation_country">Canada</span>
</span>
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_email"><span class="ltx_contact_name">email: </span><a href="mailto:nie@iro.umontreal.ca">nie@iro.umontreal.ca</a>
